// Ch5 B06 "The inn gate" (act1_ch05.md). In-engine, 21:40, P06 at night. The party takes rooms.
// Kerrid declines the inn with a shake of the head and stands at the gate. Rhen brings him a bowl
// from the kitchen; Kerrid takes it, sets it on the gate post untouched, and goes back to watching
// the dark toward the sea. No line from Kerrid. Rhen eats it himself on the step, keeping him company
// without meaning to. Clues planted (kerrid.md): he never eats, he declines inns; both read as a
// quiet man's habits. Ends on black: the chapter flow takes the party to Ashcrown in the morning.
title: ch05_inn_gate
location: ch05/pemakar
---
@camera P06N
@music lanternfall fade=2.0
@anim kerrid shake_head
@mark kerrid inn_gate walk
@wait 1.0
@anim rhen give_bowl kerrid
@anim kerrid set_bowl_down
@wait 1.5
@anim kerrid look_at sea
Rhen [neutral]: ...Suit yourself. #line:ch05_inn_001
@anim rhen eat_on_step
@wait 2.0
@fade out 1.5
===
